// One of the young men of Brigodunon who wants the war.
=== start
"Cenabum! Did you hear? Every Roman in the town, dead." His face is bright. "The Arverni are rising. All of Gaul. And the elders sit in the hall and talk."
* "Some of us have family in Roman hands." -> family
* "You sound pleased." -> pleased
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== family
He flushes. "I know. I know that. But if we join the war and win, we'll get them back anyway, won't we?" He wants you to say yes.
* "Maybe." -> END
* "If we lose, they die first." -> END

=== pleased
"Shouldn't I be? My father says the Romans took his father's land on the coast, the year before I was born. Now we can take it back." He grips his spear. "You'll see."
* "I'm sure I will." -> END
